  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid Quantum A3C reinforcement learning agent using an 8‑qubit depth‑2 variational circuit as a feature encoder for S&P 500 trading. In a 2022–2024 weekly backtest, the Quantum A3C with LSTM forecast signals achieved 30.13% cumulative return and Sharpe ratio 4.01 versus ~11.5–14.9% return and Sharpe 1.38–1.74 for classical A3C variants. All experiments were performed in simulation using PennyLane-based circuits.",
  "experiments": [
